<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Sign Up</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/global.css">
  <script src="/js/main.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/header') %>
<div class="page-body">

  <!-- Marketplace Info -->
   <section class="info-container">
    <h6>who can trade on micromarket exchange</h6>
    <h1>A verified marketplace for the industry</h1>
    <h3>Micromarket Exchange is built exclusively for licensed feed manufacturers.
    Every buyer and seller on our platform is verified before they can list, so you always know who you're dealing with.</h3>
    <div class="bubble-container">
      <div class="membership-types-container">
        <div class="callout-bubble">
          <h6>account registration</h6>
          <h1>Join Micromarket Exchange</h1>
          <h3>Micromarket Exchange is a marketplace for licensed agricultural operations. 
            <span style="font-weight: 800;">Select the option below that descripbes your operation to sign up.</span> 
            Only FDA-licensed operations and licensed feed mills may buy ot sell. 
            A third party memebrship is available for viewing products only.</h3>
        </div>

        <div class="full-membership">
          <h6>full membership</h6>
          <h2>FDA-licensed operations</h2>
          <p>FDA-licensed farms and operations approved to list feed ingredients for sale on the platform.</p>
          <div class="type-tag">Buy & Sell</div>
        </div>

        <div class="full-membership">
          <h6>full membership</h6>
          <h2>Verified businesses</h2>
          <p>Licensed feed mills and brick-and-mortar operations who need to source verified ingredients.</p>
          <div class="type-tag">Buy & Sell</div>
        </div>

        <div class="third-party-membership">
          <h6>third-party members</h6>
          <h2>Industry Experts</h2>
          <p>Consultants, researchers and industry professionals can view the marketplace.</p>
          <div class="type-tag">View Only</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="l-subtext">No traders. No middlemen. Only licensed operations whith a physical presence can buy or sell.</div>
   </section>

   <hr>

   <!-- Listing Process Section -->
    <section class="info-container">
      <h6>listing process</h6>
      <h1 class="lightweight">Every listing is reviewed before it goes live</h1>
      <h3>We manually approve all submissions, including photos, to keep listing quality high and the marketplace trustworthy.</h3>

      <div class="list-container">

        <div class="list-item">
          <div class="number">1</div>
          <div class="text-container">
            <h2>Submit your listing</h2>
            <p>Provide product details, quantity, asking price, and clear photos of what you're selling.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <hr>

        <div class="list-item">
          <div class="number">2</div>
          <div class="text-container">
            <h2>Review & approval</h2>
            <p>Our team reviews your submission for accuracy and quality.
              We check photos too - blurry, misleading, or low quality images won't make it through.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <hr>

        <div class="list-item">
          <div class="number">3</div>
          <div class="text-container">
            <h2>Listing goes live</h2>
            <p>Once approved, your listing is visible to all qualified buyers on the marketplace.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <hr>

        <div class="list-item">
          <div class="number">4</div>
          <div class="text-container">
            <h2>Sale completes or listing expires</h2>
            <p>If your item sells, the commission is deducted from your final payout - nothing to pay upfront.
              If it doesn't sell in the 14-day period, you can relist.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Pricing Section -->

    <section class="info-container">

      <h6>fees & pricing</h6>
      <h1 class="lightweight">Simple, seller-side fees</h1>
      <h3>Buyers pay only listing price + sales tax. 
        Sellers pay an initial listing fee and a percentage of the completed sale.
        No hidden platform fees.
      </h3>

      <div class="bubble-list-container">
        <h2>Marketplace fee structure</h2>

        <div class="list-item">
          <div class="text-container">
            <h2 class="bold">Listing fee</h2>
            <p class="gold">Charged when your listing is approved and goes live.</p>
            <h2>Per listing</h2>
          </div>
        </div>

        <hr>

        <div class="list-item">
          <div class="text-container">
            <h2 class="bold">Sale commission</h2>
            <p class="gold">Deducted from seller's payout when a sale completes. Buyers pay the listed price + tax.</p>
            <h2>% of final sale</h2>
          </div>
        </div>

        <hr>

        <div class="list-item">
          <div class="text-container">
            <h2 class="bold">Relisting</h2>
            <p class="gold">Unsold listings that are unlisted after 14 days in the marketplace can be resubmitted.</p>
            <h2>After 14 days</h2>
          </div>
        </div>
        
      </div>

    </section>

    <div id="infopage-cta">
      <div class="text-container">
        <p class="bold">Ready to list an ingredient?</p>
        <p>Fill out the product listing form. 
          Our team will review all submissions within 1-2 business days.
        </p>
        <button class="list-button">List Product</button>
      </div>
    </div>

</div>
  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>